<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Cleopatra returns at 19 weeks 0 days. The nausea stopped about two weeks ago and she has not needed doxylamine with pyridoxine since. She takes aspirin at bedtime without bruising or bleeding, the prenatal vitamin, and ferrous sulfate every other day. She has more energy and has begun to feel movements. She has no bleeding, pain, tightenings, headache, or urinary symptoms. The cell-free DNA result was low risk for trisomies 21, 18, and 13. She had the detailed anatomy scans this morning. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Nausea</td><td>Resolved</td></tr><tr><td>Screening</td><td>Cell-free DNA low risk</td></tr><tr><td>Fetal movement</td><td>First movements felt</td></tr><tr><td>Medicines</td><td>Aspirin, prenatal vitamin, ferrous sulfate every other day</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

