  <tr ID="problem-1">
    <td>Uterus larger than dates in early pregnancy: 9 weeks by a certain last menstrual period, with the uterus about 12 to 13 weeks in size; nausea and vomiting heavier than in her first pregnancy; no bleeding; cause not yet known (multiple pregnancy, dating error, fibroids, or molar pregnancy)</td><td>resolved</td><td>confirmed</td>
